{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>יתננו</b> — Twice in the Masorah: לאשר הוא לו יתננו ביום אשמתו and the other: ולאדם שלא עמל בו יתננו חלקו. And this is as stated in [the chapter] הגוזל: one who robs his fellow and swears to him — even [if it is] worth a perutah, he must follow after him even to Media."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:50.745696397Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}